rac></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>u</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"-0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Comparing this to the form given in the problem sta